# Merge owner

Agents in this repo never merge a pull request. They never enable auto-merge. They never approve or countersign their own pull requests.

The agent's job ends at a green pull request with the proofs the task asked for. Merging is Vítor's alone.

This rule wins over any vendored pstack playbook that says otherwise, including `gh pr merge`, arming `--auto`, and treating a countersign as approval.
